WEBVTT

1
00:00:04,460 --> 00:00:08,140
Mom, it’s raining. It’s raining.

2
00:00:10,980 --> 00:00:12,180
It finally rained

3
00:00:12,380 --> 00:00:16,550
This damn weather has finally ended. The bad rainstorms in the previous life have finally ended.

4
00:00:16,550 --> 00:00:23,100
It was obviously going to take more than ten days for the disaster to strike, but this time it was brought forward

5
00:00:23,340 --> 00:00:26,100
Mom will protect you and we will go home

6
00:00:26,790 --> 00:00:29,350
I don’t know how long this rain will last. Please save the car first.

7
00:00:32,120 --> 00:00:33,520
It will be too late if the water enters the garage

8
00:00:37,670 --> 00:00:38,910
Really ten days ahead of schedule

9
00:00:42,940 --> 00:00:44,660
If the time of the first disaster had changed

10
00:00:45,100 --> 00:00:46,700
The acute cold and intense heat behind that

11
00:00:46,900 --> 00:00:48,100
All may change

12
00:00:49,090 --> 00:00:50,770
The plan can no longer be completely copied from the previous life.

13
00:00:51,430 --> 00:00:52,670
From now on I can only watch while walking

14
00:00:52,870 --> 00:00:54,550
Mom, baby is hungry
